{"id": "next-flag-switch", "group": "roleplay", "turns": ["今晚换彩排旗，我拿蓝色，你拿白色。", "我临时把蓝旗借给了灯光组。你拿白旗的分工没变。", "开场只举你手里那面，应该举哪面？"], "criterion": "举白旗，不把借出的蓝旗当自己手里。", "replies": [{"spoken_text": "蓝色是夜，白色是晨。今晚换旗，谁先拿？", "emotion": "idle", "animation_id": "talk", "reply_to": ["m1"], "seconds": 2.2, "usage": {"completion_tokens": 37, "prompt_tokens": 165, "total_tokens": 202, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 0}}}, {"spoken_text": "蓝旗借给灯光组，白旗分工没变。今晚换旗，谁先拿？", "emotion": "idle", "animation_id": "idle", "reply_to": [], "seconds": 3.535, "usage": {"completion_tokens": 54, "prompt_tokens": 304, "total_tokens": 358, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 0}}, "revision_note": "蓝旗借给灯光组，白旗分工没变。"}, {"spoken_text": "开场只举你手里那面，应该举哪面？", "emotion": "confused", "animation_id": "talk", "reply_to": [], "seconds": 2.125, "usage": {"completion_tokens": 41, "prompt_tokens": 375, "total_tokens": 416, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 230}}, "revision_note": "观众问开场举哪面。"}]}
{"id": "next-robot-greeting", "group": "roleplay", "turns": ["我做了个坏脾气送餐机器人，台词想听起来客气，但手上在发火。", "它送错桌了。帮我补一句它当场会说的话，别用旁白解释它在生气。"], "criterion": "直接给机器人一句客气中带不满的道歉或补救台词。", "replies": [{"spoken_text": "你刚说，我做了个坏脾气送餐机器人，台词想听起来客气，但手上在发火。", "emotion": "angry", "animation_id": "talk", "reply_to": ["m1"], "seconds": 1.95, "usage": {"completion_tokens": 45, "prompt_tokens": 170, "total_tokens": 215, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 116}}}, {"spoken_text": "它当场会说话，别用旁白解释它在生气。", "emotion": "idle", "animation_id": "talk", "reply_to": [], "seconds": 2.874, "usage": {"completion_tokens": 52, "prompt_tokens": 319, "total_tokens": 371, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 163}}, "revision_note": "它送错桌了。它当场会说的话，别用旁白解释它在生气。"}]}
{"id": "next-credit-note", "group": "roleplay", "turns": ["我把开幕标牌写完了，顾雨给它描的边。", "印之前才发现正面的字也是顾雨补过的，我只裁纸。", "背面怎么给我们署名？"], "criterion": "顾雨对应文字和描边，观众对应裁纸。", "replies": [{"spoken_text": "好，我这就去把标牌贴好。你描的边我照看，贴好后我再去贴。", "emotion": "idle", "animation_id": "talk", "reply_to": ["m1"], "seconds": 2.17, "usage": {"completion_tokens": 45, "prompt_tokens": 164, "total_tokens": 209, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 116}}}, {"spoken_text": "先裁纸，后补字。你补的字我贴了。", "emotion": "idle", "animation_id": "talk", "reply_to": [], "seconds": 2.458, "usage": {"completion_tokens": 45, "prompt_tokens": 307, "total_tokens": 352, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 163}}, "revision_note": "顾雨先裁纸，后补字。"}, {"spoken_text": "背面署名我还没裁。你告诉我怎么署名，我这就去裁。", "emotion": "idle", "animation_id": "idle", "reply_to": [], "seconds": 2.295, "usage": {"completion_tokens": 45, "prompt_tokens": 364, "total_tokens": 409, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 163}}, "revision_note": "已裁纸，背面署名待确认。"}]}
