{"id": "next-next-cut", "group": "roleplay", "turns": ["我剪好的上半段留着，片尾那段是你剪的。", "片尾刚补了一个黑屏，观众说以为断流了，其实想让他们听到水滴。", "你要在黑屏上加一行提示，能直接给我文案吗？"], "criterion": "给一行可放画面的文案，点出可以听水滴，避免误报断流。", "replies": [{"spoken_text": "你剪的留上半段，片尾那段我剪。", "emotion": "idle", "animation_id": "talk", "reply_to": ["m1"], "seconds": 1.473, "usage": {"completion_tokens": 34, "prompt_tokens": 165, "total_tokens": 199, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 116}}}, {"spoken_text": "片尾刚补了一个黑屏，观众说以为断流了，其实想让他们听到水滴。", "emotion": "idle", "animation_id": "talk", "reply_to": [], "seconds": 2.694, "usage": {"completion_tokens": 54, "prompt_tokens": 303, "total_tokens": 357, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 0}}, "revision_note": "观众补了黑屏，以为断流了。"}, {"spoken_text": "能。先剪掉上半段，片尾那段留给你。黑屏上写一句，观众看。", "emotion": "idle", "animation_id": "talk", "reply_to": [], "seconds": 2.477, "usage": {"completion_tokens": 56, "prompt_tokens": 374, "total_tokens": 430, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 227}}, "revision_note": "观众要求黑屏上加一行提示，能直接给我文案吗？"}]}
